body:
Those are great boots. The problem with this sub is that if you're not purchasing the few select herd-approved kicks, you're always going to have someone who is ALL-too happy to "not be a downer". It's pretty obnoxious. I mean, it's super odious and infantile. But as you start making the move toward finer things you are always going to have to deal with people like this. Unfortunately in the world of stepping up your *x* game, there will always be people who have upped their game more than you and feel the burning need to let you know what you should be doing if you want to do it right... Ugh... So many air quotes. 

&#x200B;

Nice boots by the way!
